ties":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1791584634,"sha":"6562b71410672b9a32c790cd8215152d3fbe7eec","subject":"feat(agenda): add -t/--tasks resolved agenda to bob capture-pomodoros"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"ae1de4853379fad75cec0ac8373a5a9f856cdc81c2e5f7f7dfe4ed5892021b3c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-66.1/chat.md","size_bytes":3144},"commits":{"digest":"b7813001043f3eec56ef4f98b27497f9c8d154467916243b6dd5ad9f03796d23","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-66.1/commits.json","size_bytes":247},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-66.1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"3ffb90b5eea022c5e073e86c5e738f289fb5a0b33d1ccb859e42494382b79955","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-66.1/meta.json","size_bytes":7930},"prompt":{"digest":"64cb3db8fbecacce5b1fcccebe8de5e3bcadd4a9d8b3c40221afc6fc83f2ab0c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-66.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":189},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"cdfe5d1903de64b4ff3b47e932e6b8b4276b310a2cb733d7f3760ec5a1e95241","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-66.1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":6366},"state":{"digest":"110cb9ed39675a45c12b665e3e5875cf0aac83725067ee983fe1d22bbd1b5f9b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-66.1/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-10-09T22:26:44.230482+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-66.1","local_name":"bob-cli-66.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-66","agent_clan_generation":"20261009174528","bead_id":"bob-cli-66.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-66[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Idle Pomodoro agenda: an empty Bob Mac Capture panel shows the [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]running Pomodoro and everything queued after it[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]When the capture panel opens with an empty draft, it already shows [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]today's agenda, painted from memory in the first frame: the running[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Pomodoro and every future Pomodoro, each with its linked tasks at [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the most detail that fits below a fixed eye line without scrolling.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]The `=x` and `=` numbers match the ones bob will use. Detail folds [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]per Pomodoro, farthest first: logs, then one-line tasks, then one [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]row per Pomodoro, then a name strip. bob owns every fact; the app [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]owns caching, fitting, and pixels.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]idle_capture_pomodoro_agenda.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/idle_capture_pomodoro_agenda.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-66[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-66/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob capture-pomodoros --tasks returns the resolved agenda[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-agenda[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-agenda: add the additive `-t/--tasks` flag to `bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-pomodoros`. It returns roles, role-specific operator numbers, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolved Task Links with clean titles, statuses, and log-tagged block [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lines, plus ledger notes, session notes, retired counts, the date, and a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completed summary. One memoized pass, deterministic bytes, colored human[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]output, docs, golden fixtures, and a read-count perf gate.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Agenda JSON models, client call, fake-bob branch, and fixtures[bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-agenda-models[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-agenda[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-agenda-models: add the CaptureCore `CaptureAgendaSnapshot` decoders [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](decodeIfPresent everywhere), [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`BobProcessClient.captureAgenda(previous:)` with a byte-compare short [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]circuit and old-bob detection, a fake-bob `--tasks` branch, and fixtures[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]copied from bob-cli goldens, all with tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]In-memory agenda store, refresh triggers, path-filtered [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]watcher, count from snapshot[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-agenda-store[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-agenda-models[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-agenda-store: add the pure refresh state machine and relevance [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]filter in CaptureCore, and the @MainActor `CaptureAgendaStore` that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refreshes on launch, filtered vault events, show, submit, wake, unlock, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and midnight. It replaces the per-show capture-pomodoros spawn, derives [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the close-comma count from the snapshot, passes FSEvents paths through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the watcher, and falls back for an old bob.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Agenda presentation, inline text, and the focus-gradient fit [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]planner[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-agenda-planner[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-agenda-models[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-agenda-planner: add the pure CaptureCore `CaptureAgendaPresentation`[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](groups, rows, row keys, duplicates, chips, strings), [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`CaptureAgendaInlineText`, `CaptureAgendaLayoutMetrics`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`CaptureAgendaBudget`, the countdown wording, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`CaptureAgendaFitPlanner` (the seven-step farthest-first ladder with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]manual expansions). Table-driven tests run on Linux.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Agenda view, row measurer, panel integration, and fixed eye [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]line[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-agenda-view[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-agenda-store, mac-agenda-planner[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-agenda-view: build `CaptureAgendaView` and its row views, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]offscreen `CaptureAgendaRowMeasurer`, model wiring (visibility, plan, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]expansions, settle while hidden), auxiliary-region integration with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]height cap, fixed eye-line placement instead of re-centring, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Settings toggle. Add height-consistency and rendered design tests, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]checked from the CI artifact.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Transitions, countdown, stale and error states, accessibility,[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]signposts, README[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-agenda-polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-agenda-view[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-agenda-polish: add the first-keystroke dim-hold, the in-place [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cross-fade, the Now countdown, stale, loading, unsupported, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]multiple-timed states, a Settings diagnostic, accessibility containers [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and values, `agenda-*` signposts, a show-path spawn guard test, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README rewrite of the no-dead-space principle plus a new `## Idle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agenda` section.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Decisions record, final verification, follow-ups, and Bryan's [bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]checklist[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]closeout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-agenda-polish[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]closeout: write the accepted `decisions` record for the idle agenda (if [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the memory decision is on), confirm docs and README coherence across [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]both repos, re-run the final checks, record proposed follow-ups, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]leave Bryan the manual Mac checklist.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-66","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-66.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ce833729d6f019639f6167723c5e1b6a","started_at":"2026-10-09T21:47:05.027784+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"46e335ba0bbc97ed05e6116828cb5e06e779f097227c711a43126be4d0b57afe","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-66.2--mon-0/chat.md","size_bytes":47898},"commits":{"digest":"48d4d2cc483710ddfa345e137317688598080f98db6c47cecb3d38ddb2da777d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-66.2--mon-0/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"bf4f31515fe443df683264a904d39d6a8fb6ec76d1c3fc28df466f296b931a28","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-66.2--mon-0/meta.